ES:
Anda,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} volvemos a encontrarnos.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¿A ti también te gusta el café
que prepara {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Fígaro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?

TRANSLATION:
Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} gezgin kahve tutkunu geri
dönmüş. Sen de{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Brewster'ın{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}
demlemelerini{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} seviyorsun demek?

DE:
Hey, wir treffen uns hier aber oft.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mach dich locker und genieß deinen
Kaffee, {{TAG:000E:0006:0A0041006D00690067006F0008005300FC00DF006500}}.

Welches meine Lieblingssorte ist?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Hmmm{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Da kommt eigentlich nur
die {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Hausmischung{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} in Frage.

EN:
How much milk goes in my cup?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Nada. I {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}don't{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} put any milk in my
coffee. That's what they'd expect.

ES:
¿Que si me gusta con leche?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
No, yo siempre tomo el café {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
Me gustan los sabores auténticos.

TRANSLATION:
Fincanıma ne kadar süt?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Sıfır.{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
Kahveme{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} süt koymam. Zaten benden
beklenen de bu.

EN:
How much sugar goes in my blend?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}None{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}. Not a single grain to add to
my pain.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Coffee's gotta be pure.

ES:
¿Que si le echo azúcar?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Vaya preguntitas me haces...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
No, me gusta el café {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}sin nada{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.

IT:
Come dici? Quanto zucchero?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Fai delle domande strane tu, lo sai?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Comunque, {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}niente zucchero {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}per me.

TRANSLATION:
Harmana ne kadar şeker? Hiç.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
Acıma{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} tek bir tane bile tatlılık
eklemem{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}. Kahve saf kalmalı.

EN:
You comin' to my show, {{TAG:000E:0006:0E00640061006400640079002D006F000E006D006F006D006D0079002D006F00}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Come see me in action tonight.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'll lay down the face-meltin' beats.

TRANSLATION:
Bu gece gösterime geliyor musun,
{{TAG:000E:0006:0E00640061006400640079002D006F000E006D006F006D006D0079002D006F00}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Gel de beni sahnede gör.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Kulakları eriten ritimleri sereceğim.

IT:
Mi serve una bella tazza del caffè
di {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Bartolo {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}prima di un concerto.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Mi carica di energia!

EN:
Long time ago, I used to do a
coffee-shop concert in an old
café of {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Brewster{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'s.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
Hace mucho solía dar
conciertos en la antigua
cafetería de {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Fígaro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
Au début de ma carrière, je jouais
dans un des anciens cafés de
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Robusto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
Molto tempo fa, ho fatto
un piccolo concerto nel vecchio
locale di {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Bartolo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
Uzun zaman önce Brewster'ın eski
bir kafesinde kahvehane
konserleri{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}} verirdim{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
I've been a fan of {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Brewster{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'s coffee
for a long time now.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Even if the café shifts,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
the soul is still there.

ES:
Llevo ya años tomando el café
que prepara {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Fígaro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Puede que el local cambie,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
pero el sabor es siempre el mismo.

IT:
Mi è sempre piaciuto il caffè di
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Bartolo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}. È tanto tempo che lo bevo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Il locale è cambiato molte volte,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ma l'aroma è sempre quello.

EN:
I remember when I used to sit on an
overturned orange box and perform
on the street.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
Aún recuerdo cuando tocaba en
la calle sentado sobre una caja
de naranjas puesta del revés.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
Je me rappelle de l'époque où je
jouais dans la rue, assis sur une
vieille cagette de légumes.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
Un tempo suonavo per strada...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Prendevo una cassetta della frutta,
la giravo e mi ci sedevo sopra
per suonare.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
Ich erinnere mich noch, wie ich als
Straßenmusiker auf umgedrehten
Orangenkisten gesessen habe...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}¿Eh? ¿Qué dices, {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Fígaro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Si por
aquel entonces todavía no me
habías conocido...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
